LanguageData.OA_LetterRobResearcherCamp:
Your expedition team suddenly appeared in front of this unlucky group of scholars, and threatened them that if they did not pay a certain amount of protection fee, they would encounter extremely terrifying things, and of course, these frightened scholars followed suit.
Received: Sliver × {0}
By the time you had just counted the silver they had delivered, this group of scholars had already fled with their sleeping bags on their backs and disappeared without a trace.

